exit: 1
--- stdout

--- stderr
Unknown command "bogus"

Usage: agentsi <command> [options]

  up        Start Postgres and apply migrations
  doctor    Check the tools that AgentSI needs
  migrate   Apply pending SQL migrations
  data      Move data of an old data root into the database
  backup    Dump the database and copy the registry into the backups folder of the data root
  whoami    Detect the product of a directory
  desk      Open the front desk: product, index, status and pending decisions as one JSON object
  index     Update the knowledge base index
  status    Product state, pending decisions and last minutes
  snapshot  Markdown context for a meeting
  check     Run the pass/fail check on a minutes file
  audit     Health of the product's config, meetings, marks and memory (deterministic)
  meet      Run a meeting
  ask       Ask one role one question
  decide    Approve or reject a pending decision
  decision  Record a pending decision outside a meeting
  story     Stories mode: propose, approve, run and review stories
  mark      Mark priorities of a minutes file, or walk through everything pending
  archive   Hide a minutes file, a pending decision or a story from the lists and counts; nothing is deleted
  restore   Bring an archived minutes file, decision or story back to the lists
  roles     Roster of the product (validate: check it; apply: install a staged brief and roster)
  reset     Return an agent (or the whole product) to the global roles; --all drops brief, overlays, specialists and custom roles
  reflect   Curate each agent's memory, then propose one prompt change gated by replay (revert: undo one)
  render    Render the audio of a meeting
  voice     Turn voice mode on or off for the current Claude Code session
  web       Start the web app
  mcp       Run the MCP server on stdio

